		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Massive, legendary porcupine with a weasel-like body and a thicket of barbed quills. One of the Tane, living fey war machines.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 57, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 bite +9 (2d8) or 3 quill (far) +8 (2d6), <strong>MV</strong> near (climb), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> -3, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 12</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Brutality</strong>. Bandersnatch critically hits on 19-20.</p><p></p><p><strong>Quills</strong>. Creatures striking bandersnatch in melee, DEX 15+ or take 2d6 damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Regenerate</strong>. Unless reduced to 0 HP, regains 2d6 HP on its turn.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
